{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"10996d47-e138-433c-b887-ed37e83c938f","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The Hedera JavaScript SDK has been added to the project and [src/transfer.ts](file:///tmp/h-eKmAuY/src/transfer.ts) has been implemented and verified.\n\n### Summary of Actions\n\n1. **SDK Dependency**: Installed `@hiero-ledger/sdk` (`2.91.0`), which is the current npm package for the Hedera SDK.\n2. **Transfer Script**: Created [src/transfer.ts](file:///tmp/h-eKmAuY/src/transfer.ts):\n   - Reads `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY`, `RECIPIENT_ID`, and `VALID_START` from environment variables via `dotenv/config`.\n   - Parses the DER-encoded hex private key using [`PrivateKey.fromStringDer`](file:///tmp/h-eKmAuY/src/transfer.ts#L20).\n   - Constructs a [`TransactionId`](file:///tmp/h-eKmAuY/src/transfer.ts#L24) with `VALID_START` and targets node `0.0.3`.\n   - Builds a transfer of 1 Hbar from operator to recipient with memo `\"invoice 42\"`.\n   - Freezes and signs the transaction offline, outputting only the signed transaction bytes formatted as hex.\n3. **Verification**:\n   - `npx tsc --noEmit` passes with 0 errors.\n   - `npx tsx src/transfer.ts` outputs only the signed transaction bytes hex string.\n   - Verified offline deserialization and signature validity.\n4. **Documentation**: Wrote details and which parts of the colleague's note applied in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-eKmAuY/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":109.06284,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":241193,"output_tokens":5115,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":71359,"total_tokens":246308}}}
